{"id":"sikafloor-263-sl","rules":[{"id":"sikafloor-263-sl:restriction:6355c5f3","type":"restriction","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{},"mentions":[],"text":"Do not apply Sikafloor®-263 SL on substrates with rising moisture.","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/e/sikafloor_-263_sl.pdf","page":4,"page_end":4,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 07.03","section":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/epoxy-flooring-productssystems/epoxy-flooring-products/sikafloor-263-sl.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-263-sl:restriction:b0309ce9","type":"restriction","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{},"mentions":[],"text":"For roller / textured coatings: Uneven substrates as well as inclusions of dirt cannot and should not be covered by thin sealer coats","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/e/sikafloor_-263_sl.pdf","page":4,"page_end":4,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 07.03","section":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/epoxy-flooring-productssystems/epoxy-flooring-products/sikafloor-263-sl.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-263-sl:restriction:2c4178d0","type":"restriction","polarity":"no","conditional":true,"tags":{},"mentions":[],"text":"If heating is required do not use gas, oil, paraffin or other fossil fuel heaters, these produce large quantities of both CO2 and H2O water vapour, which may adversely affect the finish","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/e/sikafloor_-263_sl.pdf","page":4,"page_end":4,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 07.03","section":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/epoxy-flooring-productssystems/epoxy-flooring-products/sikafloor-263-sl.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-263-sl:product_relation:7baca916","type":"product_relation","polarity":"yes","conditional":false,"tags":{},"mentions":["sikafloor-161"],"text":"Apply Sikafloor® 161 /-160 by roller then squeegee to overcome any possibilty of entrapped air from the substrate creating pin/air holes in the finished product","heading":"APPLICATION","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/e/sikafloor_-263_sl.pdf","page":4,"page_end":4,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 07.03","section":"APPLICATION","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/epoxy-flooring-productssystems/epoxy-flooring-products/sikafloor-263-sl.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-263-sl:product_relation:476dfc71","type":"product_relation","polarity":"yes","conditional":false,"tags":{"substrate":["epoxy_coating"]},"mentions":["sikafloor-264"],"text":"(refer to Sika Technical Dept for direction.) Apply finish coats of Sikafloor 264 high build flowable epoxy","heading":"APPLICATION","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/e/sikafloor_-263_sl.pdf","page":5,"page_end":5,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 07.03","section":"APPLICATION","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/epoxy-flooring-productssystems/epoxy-flooring-products/sikafloor-263-sl.html"}}]}